help_rc=0
Usage: nix run .#home-switch -- [--target OUTPUT] [home-manager args...]

Defaults:
  x86_64-linux -> standalone-linux
  aarch64-linux -> standalone-linux-aarch64
  backup extension -> hm-backup (deterministic)

Examples:
  nix run .#home-switch
  nix run .#home-switch -- --dry-run
  nix run .#home-switch -- --target standalone-linux --dry-run
  nix run .#home-switch -- --backup-ext my-backup --dry-run
invalid_target_rc=2 stderr=warning: Nix search path entry '/home/mei/.nix-defexpr/channels' does not exist, ignoring home-switch: unsupported target 'unsupported' (choose standalone-linux or standalone-linux-aarch64) 
invalid_ext_rc=2 stderr=warning: Nix search path entry '/home/mei/.nix-defexpr/channels' does not exist, ignoring home-switch: backup extension must be a safe nonempty name 
